{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/how-to-read-a-weather-forecast/audio/main-67f83123a394.mp3","durationSec":114.384,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.16,"text":"A forecast often shows a high temperature and a low temperature."},{"start":3.66,"end":5.78,"text":"The high is the warmest temperature expected."},{"start":6.22,"end":7.36,"text":"The low is the coolest."},{"start":8.32,"end":11.24,"text":"First check whether the numbers use Celsius or Fahrenheit."},{"start":11.84,"end":16.32,"text":"Imagine a high of 22°C and a low of 12°C."},{"start":16.32,"end":19.76,"text":"A light shirt may work at midday, but you may want a jacket later."},{"start":21.32,"end":24.32,"text":"Sky words describe how much of the sky has clouds."},{"start":24.92,"end":28.7,"text":"The National Weather Service uses sunny or clear for very few clouds."},{"start":29.22,"end":32.16,"text":"Partly cloudy means some clouds and some open sky."},{"start":32.94,"end":35.14,"text":"Cloudy means clouds cover nearly all the sky."},{"start":36,"end":39.62,"text":"Clouds alone do not tell you the rain chance, so check the rain percent too."},{"start":40.68,"end":43.22,"text":"A wind forecast gives a direction and a speed."},{"start":43.68,"end":47.24,"text":"The speed may be in miles per hour, or mph."},{"start":47.24,"end":56.7,"text":"The National Weather Service calls 0–5 mph light wind, 15–25 mph breezy, and 20–30 mph windy."},{"start":57.08,"end":60.38,"text":"The ranges can overlap, so read the number too."},{"start":60.38,"end":63.84,"text":"On a breezy day, hold loose things and choose a jacket that closes."},{"start":64.98,"end":68.68,"text":"A rain percent is the probability of precipitation, or POP."},{"start":69.72,"end":74.1,"text":"It is the chance of measurable rain at your location during the forecast period."},{"start":74.72,"end":77.38,"text":"It is not the percent of the day that it will rain."},{"start":78.16,"end":86.4,"text":"The National Weather Service calls 20% a slight chance, 30–50% a chance, and 60–70% likely."},{"start":87.14,"end":89.74,"text":"Always check which time period the percent describes."},{"start":90.34,"end":102.1,"text":"Now imagine this forecast: high 22°C, low 12°C, partly cloudy, breezy at 18 mph, and 60% rain in the afternoon."},{"start":103.12,"end":104.96,"text":"Bring a light jacket for the cooler time."},{"start":105.46,"end":106.96,"text":"Keep a hat secure in the wind."},{"start":107.42,"end":110.08,"text":"Take an umbrella and choose an indoor backup for the afternoon."},{"start":110.08,"end":113.84,"text":"One short forecast can help you make several useful choices."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.18},{"text":"forecast","start":0.18,"end":0.58},{"text":"often","start":0.58,"end":0.98},{"text":"shows","start":0.98,"end":1.28},{"text":"a","start":1.28,"end":1.52},{"text":"high","start":1.52,"end":1.76},{"text":"temperature","start":1.76,"end":2.2},{"text":"and","start":2.2,"end":2.42},{"text":"a","start":2.42,"end":2.52},{"text":"low","start":2.52,"end":2.7},{"text":"temperature","start":2.7,"end":3.16},{"text":"The","start":3.66,"end":3.74},{"text":"high","start":3.74,"end":4.06},{"text":"is","start":4.06,"end":4.26},{"text":"the","start":4.26,"end":4.42},{"text":"warmest","start":4.42,"end":4.8},{"text":"temperature","start":4.8,"end":5.2},{"text":"expected","start":5.2,"end":5.78},{"text":"The","start":6.22,"end":6.38},{"text":"low","start":6.38,"end":6.62},{"text":"is","start":6.62,"end":6.84},{"text":"the","start":6.84,"end":7},{"text":"coolest","start":7,"end":7.36},{"text":"First","start":8.32,"end":8.5},{"text":"check","start":8.5,"end":8.8},{"text":"whether","start":8.8,"end":9.02},{"text":"the","start":9.02,"end":9.24},{"text":"numbers","start":9.24,"end":9.54},{"text":"use","start":9.54,"end":9.9},{"text":"Celsius","start":9.9,"end":10.2},{"text":"or","start":10.2,"end":10.78},{"text":"Fahrenheit","start":10.78,"end":11.24},{"text":"Imagine","start":11.8